Z||000016||David Bartlett||08-28-2001||01:38 PM||||Do you think you have troubles with the vinyle coverings? How do you plan to get it looking nice?||||reg||1
Z||000017||Joe Torma||08-28-2001||01:56 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by David Bartlett:<BR><B>Do you think you have troubles with the vinyle coverings? </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Absolutely.  I'm expecting one hell of a pain in the arse time doing it.<P>I think I'll be ok... There will be some well placed(read:convenient-crease hiding) screwed in accent pieces.  I discovered a little trick too.  The vinyl I got has fabric webbing glued to the back...it naturally stretches one way, but if you sand it off you can stretch it any way you want!  I'll be doing this in rough spots.<BR>I will be spray gluing 1/4 foam to every surface and then spray gluing the vinyl to that(stapled on undersides).<P>Wish me luck...I may start this tonight.<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/simplesig.gif"> ||||reg||10
